{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57134","headline":"行路难二十篇（幷序） 第十六章明魔怨 · 傅翕","name":"行路难二十篇（幷序） 第十六章明魔怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见大道寂寞叵思寻，通融万象尽皆深。\n一切恬然无起灭，颠倒分别并从心。\n智者求心无处所，茫然絶相离贪活。\n了了分明何所见，犹如病眼覩空针。\n若人体知颠倒想，不爲妄苦所浦沈。\n世间诸法如阳焰，行者慎莫致怨嫌。\n恒以空心而照，无上佛道亦能任。\n行路难，路难微妙实无双。\n若识六情空非有，衆魔结贼自然降。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}